extends ../baseEmail

block content
  h1 Hey there, #{payload.user.firstname}!

  p.
    We're thrilled to have you on board! 🎉 A Stripe customer account has been successfully created for you. 
    Please go to your dashboard > Payouts to complete your registration with Stripe and link a bank account. 
    This allows you to choose whether you'd like to receive your payouts daily, weekly, or monthly.

  p.
    Feel free to explore our platform and make the most of its amazing features. 
    From creating an event to publishing it on our discovery page, everything is just a click away!

  p If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is always ready to help at 
    a(href=`mailto:${payload.appEmail}`)= payload.appEmail

  p
    a(href=payload.dashboardLink, class='btn btn-primary') Go to Your Dashboard

  p Thank you for joining us!
  p.signature
    b The #{payload.appName} Team
